{"server":"kr","storyId":"act10d5_level_act10d5_st01","groupId":"act10d5","stageId":null,"title":"습관","storyCode":"","avgTag":"브릿지","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/kr/gamedata/story/activities/act10d5/level_act10d5_st01.txt","sourceHash":"cc9a1589f3045d6114eeb619fbe6ffd186c216e6f649b3ba1608bd0d7bc3d477","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"공격할 때 이상한 습관이 있다고 듀나에게 지적을 받아버린 굼은, 자신의 습관을 고치고자 노력했지만 뜻대로 잘되지 않았다.\n그녀의 습관은 전부 과거의 상처가 남긴 것들이었다. 이 습관들을 바꾸기 위해선, 어쩌면 조금 더 시간이 필요할지도 모르겠다.","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"古米 习惯"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"숙소에서 두 번째로 빨리 일어나는 굼에게는 습관이 하나 있다.\n이스티나가 굼을 깨우면, 굼은 이스티나의 손을 꼭 잡고 같은 방식으로 옆방의 지마를 깨운다.\n지마가 그녀의 손을 잡느냐 잡지 않느냐로, '동장군'이 깨어났을 때의 컨디션을 확인할 수 있다."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_room_2"},{"type":"narration","text":"6:30 a.m.\n로도스 아일랜드 숙소 구역 - 굼과 이스티나의 숙소"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"쿠울…… 쿠울……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(아침이다.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(윽, 이스티나 언니가 곧 올 텐데.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"흠냐…… 쿠울……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(이스티나 언니가 오늘은 좀 늦네. 요즘 피곤해서 그런가?)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(하지만 더 기다리면 아침 근무에 늦을 텐데. 언니는 그만 기다리고 일어나자, 굼.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"흠냐…… 흠냐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"(넌 할 수 있어, 굼. 힘내!)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"후…… 으음, 음."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"일어났다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"깜깜하네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"무드등이 왜 꺼졌지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"이스티나 언니? 이스티나 언니!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"이상하네, 나갔나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"한번 가보자."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"없네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"급하게 어디 나간 건가?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"무슨 일이지?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"아."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"이건……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"\"굼, 일이 있어서 나갔다가 저녁에 돌아올 거야. 몸조리 잘해.\""},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"\"이스티나……\""},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"\"……와 지마.\""},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"흥, 또 애 취급한다 이거지. 당연히 잘 지낼 수 있다구!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"지마 언니도 일어났구나."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"음……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"아, 늦었다. 빨리 가야 되는데."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"프라이팬 챙겼고, 딴딴~한 방패도 챙겼고……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"좋아, 준비 완료!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"출발!!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"narration","text":"11:28 a.m.\n로도스 아일랜드 식당 - 조리 구역"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"꼬르륵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"조금 배고픈데……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"아침에 너무 서두르느라 아무것도 못 먹었네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"일단 일부터 하고, 그다음에 먹어야겠다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"음……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"요리 끝! 배식 구역에 가져다 줘!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"듀나","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"다음은 오크로시카인가. 자, 힘내자!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"끝!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"다 됐어! 배식 구역에 가져다 줘!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"다음은…… 음, 체부레키가 남았네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"일단 배식 구역에 요리들을 가져다준 다음에, 이 요리만 하면 오전 일은 끝!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"듀나","speakerId":"char_260_durnar","isRemote":false,"text":"굼, 지금 거기까지 가기엔 너무 바쁜데! 직접 갖고 가 줄 수 있겠어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"영차."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"괜찮아. 방패보단 가벼우니까."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"어디 두면 돼?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"듀나 교관님!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"듀나 교관님~?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"이상하네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"오늘 다들 왜 이렇게 빠르지? 눈 깜짝할 사이에 사라졌네."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"뭐 어때. 배식 구역 사람들한테 직접 물어보지 뭐."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"여기일 텐데. 오늘 카운터 담당은…… 기타노 언니였나?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"기타노 언니, 안녕~!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"기타노","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"어머, 곰돌이 아가씨가 여긴 어쩐 일로?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"기타노","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"냄비를 들고 오다니, 도움이 필요한가?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"아니야 언니, 어디에다 두면 되는지만 알려줘. 이대로 놔두면 음식이 전부 식어버릴 거라구!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"기타노","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"오크로시카로군. 내 기억이 맞다면, 쿠리어가 서 있는 저 중간 자리에 두면 될 걸세."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"기타노","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"정말 도와주지 않아도 괜찮은가, 곰돌이 아가씨?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"이 정도쯤이야! 그럼 먼저 갈게 기타노 언니!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"기타노","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"스팟","speakerId":"char_284_spot","isRemote":false,"text":"뭘 봐, 난 못들어 저거."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"기타노","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"알고 있다네."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"어서오세요. 오늘은 뭘로 주문하시겠어요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"고기찜에 제철 채소 볶음… 그리고 계란찜, 네 주문 받았습니다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"주문하신 요리 나왔습니다."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"뜨거우니까 조심하세요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"감사합니다, 안녕히 가세요~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"쿠리어 오빠, 요리 가져왔어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"아! 고마워요, 굼 씨."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"천만에~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"흡!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"하앗! 이걸로 끝!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"미안한데 굼 씨, 냄비는 다시 가져가 줄 수 있을까요?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어, 쿠리어 오빠."},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"꼬르륵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"으으……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"정말 고생 많았어요. 여기, 쿠키 좀 줄 테니까 배고프면 간단하게 요기라도 해둬요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"쿠리어 오빠, 고마워!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"쿠리어","speakerId":"char_198_blackd","isRemote":false,"text":"별 거 아닌걸요, 일 다 끝나면 끼니 챙겨 먹는 거 잊지 말고요."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"그럼 난 다시 일하러 돌아가 볼게 기타노 언니."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"기타노","speakerId":"char_109_fmout","isRemote":false,"text":"조심히 가시게나."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어!"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"꼬르르륵……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"(금방 밥 먹을 수 있어. 조금만 더 참자.)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"음식들아, 내가 왔다!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"으아아아아 케오! 여기 들어오면 안 돼!!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"안 돼?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"안 돼! 문에 붙어있는 메모 못 봤어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"봤어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"빨간 동그라미 안에 빨간 대각선이 그어져 있었어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"그리고 케오 얼굴도!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"그건 '케오 출입금지'라는 뜻이야. 알겠어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"알았는데 왜 계속 들어오는 거야!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"배고파."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"배고프면 줄 서서 주문을 하라구!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"배고프다고."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"어, 어쨌든 케오는 출입금지야!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"배고파아!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"알았어 알았어 알았다구! 굼이 뭔가 방법을 생각해 볼 테니까!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"음……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"만약……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"만약 굼이 케오한테 이 쿠키 주면, 안 들어가겠다고 약속할 수 있어?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"(킁킁)"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"응!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"좋아 좋아!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"자, 여기……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"케오베","speakerId":"char_2013_cerber","isRemote":false,"text":"고마워!"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"고맙긴……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"굼","speakerId":"char_196_sunbr","isRemote":false,"text":"하…… 드디어 갔네……"},{"typ